\title{Rfrengression: Frugal, Flexible, Faithful Causal Data Simulation via Frengression}
\description{
Deep generative models for causal data simulation. Learns joint distributions of covariates, treatments, and outcomes, enabling interventional sampling via do-calculus. Implements three model classes: cross-sectional (Frengression), longitudinal (FrengressionSeq), and survival (FrengressionSurv). Based on "Frugal, Flexible, Faithful: Causal Data Simulation via Frengression" by Shen and Meinshausen (2025) \href{https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.01018}{arXiv:2508.01018}.
